```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Online Book Store - Cart</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            margin: 0;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .cart {
            width: 80%;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #ddd;
        }

        button {
            padding: 7px 12px;
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #555;
        }

        .total {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Online Book Store</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="cart">

        <h2>My Cart</h2>

        <table id="cartTable">
            <tr>
                <th>Book Name</th>
                <th>Author</th>
                <th>Price</th>
                <th>Quantity</th>
                <th>Total</th>
                <th>Action</th>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Wings of Fire</td>
                <td>A. P. J. Abdul Kalam</td>
                <td>₹250</td>
                <td>1</td>
                <td>₹250</td>
                <td>
                    <button onclick="removeBook(this)">Remove</button>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>The Alchemist</td>
                <td>Paulo Coelho</td>
                <td>₹300</td>
                <td>2</td>
                <td>₹600</td>
                <td>
                    <button onclick="removeBook(this)">Remove</button>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td>Basic Science</td>
                <td>R. Kumar</td>
                <td>₹350</td>
                <td>1</td>
                <td>₹350</td>
                <td>
                    <button onclick="removeBook(this)">Remove</button>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="total">
            Grand Total: ₹1200
        </div>

        <br>

        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <button onclick="checkout()">Proceed to Checkout</button>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        function removeBook(button) {
            var row = button.parentNode.parentNode;
            row.remove();
        }

        function checkout() {
            alert("Thank you for shopping with us!");
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
```
